<div class="sect">DEFENSE</div><div class="kv"><span>Defense rating</span><span><b><%~ it.playerPayloadDefense %></b> <span class="dim small">(turrets level <%~ it.level %>)</span></span></div><div class="dim small">Raiders hit Personal Stations every <%~ it.DEFENSEEveryH %> hours. If you are in the system they attack live and you can fight them off; otherwise the turrets decide it. A lost raid loots the refinery and some low-grade crates.</div>